    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The thick green climbing potion leaves sticky streaks on the inside of the bottle.</p><p><em>Potion, Common</em></p><p>When you drink this potion, you gain a Climb Speed equal to your Speed for 1 hour. During this time, you have Advantage on Strength (Athletics) checks to climb.</p><p>This potion is separated into brown, silver, and gray layers resembling bands of stone. Shaking the bottle fails to mix the colors.</p><section id=\"secret-HJGRSX6Nbv4iYQAX\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Climber</strong> Active Effect can be used for tracking but can not automate the effects.</p></section>",
